Pako Engineers - Contract Manufacturing Brochure

Build-to-print machining for pump OEMs, rotating equipment manufacturers, and heavy engineering customers.

Core capability:
- CNC turning, VTL machining, milling, boring, drilling, threading, grinding, and inspection
- Component diameter: up to 1500 mm
- Component weight: up to 5 tons
- Materials: stainless steel, duplex, super duplex, EN-series alloy steels, bronze, cast iron, and customer-specified grades
- Documentation: QAP, MTC, dimensional report, NDT report, and dispatch packing record

Pako Engineers supports prototype, batch, and repeat OEM production.
